Enhance the visual identity with Midnight + Aurora design system:
- Add CSS utilities: noise-overlay, aurora-glow, mesh-hero, glow-primary, skeleton-aurora, card-waveform-hover, section-divider
- FullscreenBackground: aurora gradient overlay, noise grain, multi-colored floating particles
- OnboardingSlider: replace generic gradients with branded aurora palette, add mesh-hero background
- Track cards (Grid/Enhanced): waveform hover scan effect, playing state indicator
- Button default variant: elevated hover with shadow and micro-translate

